{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1791895147,"nonce":"f/ArR/4Pt7cZHb8+pfJzT+HKNGU=","title":"Remove the exact captured canvas layout hook on disposal","message":"The editor viewport and a modal AshUI-media Video create separate sized callbacks from Canvas.render. Closing the video leaves its callback registered and removes the viewport callback instead when run with current local Ash application preset. The next layout throws Null access in LayoutTree.getBounds from Canvas.hx:110. This is Ash runtime issue 245bf6d: Array.remove compares different captured values as equal.\n\nUse Reflect.compareMethods to find the exact callback and splice its index for both Canvas settled hooks. Prepared patch: /private/tmp/chimpmonk-ashui-film-cleanup.patch, verified in /private/tmp/chimpmonk-ashui-film-check without modifying this repository. ChimpMonk RecordingSnapshot passes persistent notification, decoded native frames, close/reopen, Escape, focus restoration and dark/light captures with the patch. Unpatched close fails. Keep the Ash runtime issue open.","files":null}]}